  "name": "Dynamic Delaunay 4",
  "author": "rory618",
  "description": "Aiming for a more consistent and smooth image, using interpolated velocity of the points on the triangulation for temporal AA. Each frame the image is morphed to line up with the motion of the points, and only a bit of the new render frame is accumulated.",
